        "text_rLRFME": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<h3><strong>The Valeria Collection — Our 10-Year Anniversary, One Last Chance</strong></h3><p>Rosendale began quietly, built side by side by a mother and daughter who believed clothing should feel steady, comfortable, and easy to live in.</p><p>This year marks ten years since we started that journey together.<br/><br/>And today, we are standing at a turning point.</p><p>After a long and difficult season, the Valeria Collection has become our last chance to keep Rosendale going. As we mark our 10-year anniversary, we are opening a special anniversary sale not as a celebration alone, but as an honest effort to continue the work we began together a decade ago.</p><p>Each Valeria dress is created with the same care we have always believed in. Calm design, supportive fit, and pieces meant for real days, not passing trends. These dresses reflect where we are right now. Thoughtfully made, produced in limited quantities, and offered with transparency and heart.</p><p>Once these styles sell out, they will not be restocked.</p><p>Choosing Valeria means supporting a small, family-run brand during a defining moment and helping us continue the story we started ten years ago.</p><p>As a sincere anniversary thank-you, additional savings are applied automatically when you purchase more than one piece:</p><p>• Buy 2 dresses → 10% off<br/><br/>• Buy 3 dresses → 15% off<br/><br/>• Buy 4 dresses → 20% off<br/><br/>• Buy 5 or more dresses → 25% off</p><p>Discounts are applied automatically at checkout. Quantities are limited.</p><p>With love,<br/><br/>Anne & Laurelle Rosendale 🤍</p>"
          }
        }
